  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjO3fq8VpX06ld8eUgeJilOdLItK5WhxreRj15_NaaQ9u6jBv8DDham3eWFr2qLewlXKLkfD1pYGbaTX3fGPYBTpaGw8VRvUHr39LP7uoq5fbAmlSZ3QGVCgsLnPBTOQOCjxn9k6fCwTxXVpFh0gArMZ6q3NsdoHC67VnE4ujX784cTAy4-hFa0wziuWmg/s560/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.JPG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"370\" data-original-width=\"560\" height=\"211\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjO3fq8VpX06ld8eUgeJilOdLItK5WhxreRj15_NaaQ9u6jBv8DDham3eWFr2qLewlXKLkfD1pYGbaTX3fGPYBTpaGw8VRvUHr39LP7uoq5fbAmlSZ3QGVCgsLnPBTOQOCjxn9k6fCwTxXVpFh0gArMZ6q3NsdoHC67VnE4ujX784cTAy4-hFa0wziuWmg/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><p></p><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מפה טמונה</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את הקשר בין המפה שבראש הפוסט - לפרשה.</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">התאמה מושלמת</span></h2></div><div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">התאימו בין 2 חלקי הביטויים המופיעים בפרשה:</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שמן..........משפט<br />זהב..............זית<br />עצי...............אזן<br />זר...............זהב<br />אהל...........חתם<br />אבני...........חשב<br />נזר...............שני<br />בין..............מועד<br />מעשה.........טהור<br />תנוך..........שיטים<br />תולעת.........שהם<br />פתוחי........הקדש<br />חשן........הערבים<br />קדש.........קדשים</span><br /></span><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h2></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה כָּתִית?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כיתת בנות</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">סחיטה</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">קטטה</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כף גדולה</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>מָשְׁזָר?</li><ol><li>זריז</li><li>מישהו זָר</li><li>זֵר</li><li>שזור</li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>פִּטְדָה?</li><ol><li>סוג של אבן טובה</li><li>פשטידה שמכינים לשבת</li><li>סלט פטריות</li><li>תפודים אפויים בתנור</li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>לֹא יִזַּח?</li><ol><li>לא ישמח</li><li>לא יתנתק</li><li>לא יתאזרח</li><li>לא נקי</li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>בְּלוּלֹת?</li><ol><li>תרנגולות להטלה</li><li>טקס כלולות</li><li>בשעות הלילה</li><li>מעורבבות</li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>פֶּרֶשׁ?</li><ol><li>פרשה קטנה</li><li>לוחם על סוס</li><li>צואה</li><li>פרוסת פת</li></ol></ol></div></span></span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🔲🔲 טורף ממשפחת הכלבים<br />🔲🔲🔲 מפעל פלסטיק ישראלי<br />🔲🔲🔲🔲 החלק הראשון בשמו המצרי של יוסף<br />🔲🔲🔲🔲🔲 כובע (מהפרשה) <br />🔲🔲🔲🔲 אביזר לזיהוי רוחות השמים <br />🔲🔲🔲 התפוצצות <br />🔲🔲 עוף דורס</span><h2 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></span></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מפה טמונה</span></span></h3><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">רחוב 'חושן משפט'</span></span></div><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">התאמה מושלמת</span></span></h3><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">שמן זית<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">זהב טהור<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">עצי שיטים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">זר זהב<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אהל מועד<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אבני שהם<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">נזר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">הקדש<br />בין&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">בין&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">הערבים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מעשה חשב<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">תנוך אזן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">תולעת שני<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">פתוחי חתם<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">חשן משפט<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">קדש קדשים</span></span></p><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כתית=סחיטה<br />משזר=שזור<br />פטדה=סוג של אבן טובה<br />לא יזח=לא יתנתק<br />בלולת=מעורבבות<br />פרש=צואה</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h3><div><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-weight: 400; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">תן, תפן, צפנת,</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;מצנפת,</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-weight: 400; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">&nbsp;מצפן, נפץ, נץ</span></div></span></div></div>"
